WEBVTT

00:09:57.895 --> 00:10:00.379
of lip-synch battles
from "RuPaul's Drag Race."

00:10:00.403 --> 00:10:03.299
(Laughter)

00:10:03.323 --> 00:10:04.942
So, why do we do this?

00:10:04.966 --> 00:10:07.879
(Laughter)

00:10:07.903 --> 00:10:10.903
(Applause)

00:10:10.927 --> 00:10:12.522
You tell me, I don't know.

00:10:12.546 --> 00:10:15.196
So, first of all, it's really fun.

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:18.672
But I think it also improves
our lives in various ways.

00:10:18.696 --> 00:10:22.157
Being able to solve puzzles,
when I'm confronted with a challenge,

00:10:22.181 --> 00:10:25.332
has allowed me to explore it
from multiple perspectives

00:10:25.356 --> 00:10:27.418
before I lock in an approach.

00:10:27.442 --> 00:10:31.434
Also, the process of solving
is great training for working with a team,